{"sourceUrl":"https://geo.jlu.edu.cn/info/1116/15145.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:00:06.221092+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://geo.jlu.edu.cn/info/1116/15145.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span><span>为确保地球科学学院接收推荐免试攻读硕士学位研究生（以下简称</span><span>“</span><span>推免生</span><span>”</span><span>）工作规范有序地进行，</span></span><span><span>现开展吉林大学地球科学学院</span><span>2</span></span><span>02</span><span><span>6</span></span><span>年接收推荐免试攻读研究生预报名工作，安排如下：</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>一</span></strong><strong><span><span>、</span></span></strong><strong><span>接收推免生工作的计划和基本要求</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span>1.</span></strong><strong><span>接收计划（含直博生）：</span></strong></p>\n<div>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>学位类别</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>专业代码</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>专业名称</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>人数</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>全日制学术学位</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>0</span></span><span>70900</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>地质学</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>36</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>全日制学术学位</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>0</span></span><span>81801</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>矿产普查与勘探</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>15</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>全日制学术学位</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>1</span></span><span>20405</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>土地资源管理</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>6</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>全日制专业学位</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>0</span></span><span>85700</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>资源与环境</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>6</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p><strong><span><span>2</span></span></strong><strong><span>.</span></strong><strong><span>报考</span></strong><strong><span><span>条件：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>1<span>）拥护中国共产党的领导，具有正确的政治方向，热爱祖国，愿意为社会主义现代化建设服务，遵纪守法，品行端正。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>2<span>）具有所在学校推免生资格的优秀应届本科毕业生。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>3<span>）学术研究兴趣浓厚，有较好的专业素养，有较强的创新意识和创新能力，有较高的培养潜质。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>4<span>）身体和心理状况符合国家和招生单位规定的体检要求。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>5</span><span>）</span></span><span><span>大学外语四级考试成绩需达到合格线。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3.<span>尊重考生志愿，原则上按考生报考的学科专业安排复试。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>二</span></strong><strong><span><span>、</span></span></strong><strong><span>报名及材料提交</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>1</span></span></strong><strong><span>.</span></strong><strong><span><span>报名时间：</span><span>9</span><span>月</span></span></strong><strong><span>1</span></strong><strong><span><span>1</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>日</span><span>-</span></span></strong><strong><span>9</span></strong><strong><span>月</span></strong><strong><span><span>1</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>5</span></span></strong><strong><span>日。</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>2.</span><span>拟申请地球科学学院</span><span><span>推免</span></span><span>的考</span><span><span>生</span></span><span>要在吉林大学预推免系统中进行报名，报名网址</span><strong><span>：</span></strong><strong><span>https://yzb.jlu.edu.cn/</span></strong><span>。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>3.<span>申请材料</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>拟报名考生需要按照我校接收推免生</span></span><span>简章</span><span><span>的要求</span></span><span>提供相应材料</span><span><span>。</span></span><span><span>电子版材料须合成在</span><span>1</span><span>个</span><span>P</span></span><span>DF</span><span>文件，</span><strong><span><span><span>文件命名为：报考专业</span><span>+</span><span>姓名，并</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>于</span>202</span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>5</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>年</span>9<span>月</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>5</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>日</span>22:00<span>之前</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>发送至邮箱：</span><span>6</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span>51814099@qq.com</span></span></strong><span>，</span><span><span>逾期不再接受申请。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>申请者须提供的材料包括：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>1<span>）</span></span><span>《</span><span><span>吉林大学</span></span><span>202</span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年推免生预报名表</span></span><span>》</span><span><span>一份</span></span><span>，</span><span><span>须加盖所在学校教务处公章。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>2<span>）本科期间成绩单原件一份，须加盖所在学校教务处公章。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>3<span>）</span></span><span>长期有效第二代居民身份证、学生证复印件一份。</span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span><span>4</span><span>）</span></span><span><span>在校期间发表的论文、申请专利或其他研究成果、获奖证书和外语水平考试证书等材料的复印件</span></span><span>一份</span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>三、其他事项</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>学院将根据各专业报名情况，进行资格审核，并组织专家进行复试考核。具体工作另行安排，请各位考生关注学院官网通知。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>四、联系方式</span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>联</span></span> <span><span>系</span></span> <span><span>人：张</span>  <span>茜</span></span> </p>\n<p><span><span>联系电话：</span>0431-88502617</span></p>\n<p><span><span>Q</span></span><span>Q</span><span>群：</span><span><span>134200936</span></span></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://geo.jlu.edu.cn/__local/3/CF/C1/2FC8D67F6A94046DB0A59FF0BB3_C4ED3464_FFDE.png\"/></p>\n<p><span><span></span></span><br/></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><span>地球科</span><span><span>学学院</span></span></p>\n<p><span>202</span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>年</span>9<span>月</span><span>1</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"d98ffa700356e2ed2e3946edb826293331b30e4c3b28942377864d0a41e8ae8a","textLength":888,"sourceSha256":"5333284f21e9b9e0310ff283d9f728000d643bd1888fad6455ac4e2c78979918","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-ad7a3debc9657e4ea7a1","title":"2025年吉林大学地球科学学院2026年接收推荐免试攻读研究生预报名工作的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:00:06.221092+00:00"}
